Third-party content
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project bundles no third-party source code, libraries, art, audio or fonts.

The runtime dependencies are limited to platform APIs that are not redistributed
here:

  * The Java Standard Library (java.net, java.util, ...) - provided by the JRE
    installed on the machine running the server.
  * The Android framework and OpenGL ES - provided by the device.
  * The Kotlin standard library - resolved by Gradle at build time and
    redistributed inside the built artifacts (Apache License 2.0,
    https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin).

Build-time tooling (Gradle, the Android Gradle Plugin, the Kotlin Gradle Plugin
and JUnit) is downloaded by the build and is not part of this source
distribution. The Gradle wrapper JAR in gradle/wrapper/ is redistributed under
the Apache License 2.0 (https://github.com/gradle/gradle).

All game content is original to this project:

  * The arena "arena01" is authored as data in arena01.json.
  * The application icon is an original vector drawable.
  * There are no texture, model, audio or font assets of any kind - all
    surfaces are shaded procedurally by GLSL written for this project.
